{
  "answer_text": "Chain‑of‑thought prompting yields modest gains for smaller models but dramatically boosts accuracy on GSM8K as model size increases, roughly tripling performance from 4.1% to 15.6% for standard prompting and jumping from 4.4% to 46.9% with CoT for models up to 175B, and reaching 56.9% with CoT on the 540B PaLM.",
